    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16008" root="رغد" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَغَدٌ</span></b>  an inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَغِدَ</span>. (Msb.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى رَغَدٍ مِنَ العَيْشِ</span> <i>He is in a state of life ample
in its means</i> or <i>circumstances, unstraitened,</i> or
<i>plentiful,</i> (A, Msb,) [<i>and easy,</i>] <i>and pleasant.</i>
(A.) ― 
